<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it removed Fluor Corp from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said now rates the stock as market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Fluor dropped 2-7/16 to 59-5/8.</p>
</text>
